   - MOQ / order multiples
   - lead time
   - replacements

Source:
https://www.mouser.com/en/api-search/
DigiKey =E2=80=94 P0

Useful for:

   - product search
   - pricing / stock
   - substitutions
   - product change notifications
   - lifecycle changes

Source:
https://developer.digikey.com/
TME =E2=80=94 P0

Especially attractive:

   - free API
   - real-time warehouse stock
