Source:
https://support.nexar.com/
What to store continuously

Raw API responses are not the moat.

Store transformed snapshots:

part_market_snapshot {
part_id,
timestamp,
stock_by_supplier,
supplier_count,
median_price_1pc,
median_price_bulk,
cheapest_price,
lead_time,
lifecycle,
substitute_count
}

This lets POW answer later:

   - When did this component become scarce?
   - When did supplier concentration rise?
   - When did lead times break out?
   - When did substitutes disappear?
   - Which actuator/sensor families were repriced first?

That historical state cannot easily be reconstructed later.
Initial ontology: start with repair-rich components, not =E2=80=9Call senso=
rs=E2=80=9D P0
product families

